,"text":"云山烟树望中微，茅屋人家隔水西。\n读罢残书春昼永，短墙喔喔一声鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游玄都观","author":"朱诚泳","text":"扰扰游人去又来，乘閒也踏软红回。\n刘郎道士俱尘土，纵有桃花亦浪栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋思","author":"朱诚泳","text":"银汉无声月正辉，西风吹透越罗衣。\n玉关铁甲人多少，北雁归时尚未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"罗幕垂红护晓寒，靓妆初试佩珊珊。\n不知门外春多少，雨打梨花满地残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"雾鬓云鬟讶水仙，紫苔纹甃涩金莲。\n多情只恐鸳鸯妒，行到回塘不敢前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其三","author":"朱诚泳","text":"灯花作蕊黯银缸，花影离披月满窗。\n玉露满天凉似水，凤笙吹彻不成腔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其四","author":"朱诚泳","text":"夜合风前散晓香，露华凉沁薄罗裳。\n自怜颜色非倾国，不敢将身擅未央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其五","author":"朱诚泳","text":"锦屏绣帐郁金香，烛影摇红夜有光。\n檐铁战酣风力劲，不教飞梦落高唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其六","author":"朱诚泳","text":"竹枝何处引羊车，尽日凝妆候翠华。\n燕子不来春欲暮，东风吹老碧桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其七","author":"朱诚泳","text":"舞凤飞鸾绕汉宫，湘帘罗幕影重重。\n佩环声细香风暖，花底何人见玉容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其八","author":"朱诚泳","text":"不见黄姑度绛河，九霄风露夜如何。\n鹊桥影淡秋无迹，肠断天孙弄玉梭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其九","author":"朱诚泳","text":"人与花枝竞艳妆，重重珠翠绮罗香。\n流苏帐小银屏暗，坐倚熏笼欲断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其十","author":"朱诚泳","text":"浴罗兰汤趁晚风，画堂银烛锦屏空。\n自怜薄命终黄土，不恨丹青画未工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其十一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"照眼花枝小院春，春葱花下蹙红巾。\n玉箫吹罢瑶台月，不是昭阳殿里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其十二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"一庭淡月浸梨花，好景偏宜富贵家。\n风动珠帘香满院，玉人相对拨琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"月满西楼户半开，晚风黄叶走空阶。\n偶然得句高歌处，肯为悲秋恼壮怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其三","author":"朱诚泳","text":"玉漏沈沈夜未央，博山销尽水沈香。\n月明露下微风动，添得虚堂一味凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其四","author":"朱诚泳","text":"切切寒蛩草际鸣，露华秋气两凄清。\n空庭久坐不成寐，明月满阶砧杵声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其五","author":"朱诚泳","text":"抱得瑶琴月下弹，不知梧影过雕阑。\n长空万里秋无际，白鹤一声风露寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其六","author":"朱诚泳","text":"露下高梧夜若何，广庭云霁月明多。\n怪来诗骨清如许，一榻凉生透越罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其七","author":"朱诚泳","text":"虚堂风露两凄清，宝鸭香销冷画屏。\n卧看碧空凉似水，银河耿耿度双星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其八","author":"朱诚泳","text":"梧桐萧瑟发清商，秋入屏帏枕簟凉。\n诗思满怀浑不寐，一灯风雨乱啼螀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草","author":"朱诚泳","text":"一望蒙茸接远天，东风吹绿暖生烟。\n王孙去后无消息，落日空留醉客眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔樵图","author":"朱诚泳","text":"君托为樵我托渔，济时心在复何如。\n会稽烟月磻溪水，千古光辉照简书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月见梅","author":"朱诚泳","text":"花开常是在严冬，今岁开当二月中。\n祗恐已忘松竹旧，错将贞白斗春红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"露","author":"朱诚泳","text":"分来秋气夜漙漙，泻入仙人掌上盘。\n玉屑和餐成底事，茂陵衰草不胜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"银河","author":"朱诚泳","text":"冷浸瑶空淡欲流，素光如练夜横秋。\n月明乌鹊南飞去，疑是成桥度女牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春宴","author":"朱诚泳","text":"生色屏风四面开，春风都入管弦来。\n樽前健在休辞醉，无数飞花落酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登斗宝台","author":"朱诚泳","text":"肩舆隐隐陟崔嵬，笑问秦人斗宝台。\n胜负千年同一梦，东风惟有野花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渊明赏菊图","author":"朱诚泳","text":"解印初从栗里归，壶觞日日醉东篱。\n门前五柳俱摇落，祇有黄花是故知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之云中","author":"朱诚泳","text":"红亭绿酒郁金香，灞岸西风水气凉。\n极目云中千里外，鸟飞不尽塞天长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀娄克让 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"别来日日动遐思，又值西风过雁时。\n门掩空斋人寂静，芭蕉叶底坐题诗。","collection":"明","no